<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">-BAEFESO - Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">BaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo Lwakalembwa aPawulu kuBaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaEfeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ef</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo LwaPawulu Ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAEFESO</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lugwalo LwaPawulu kuBaEfeso</char> lwakalembwa muchiindi ichimwi alugwalo lwaBaKkolose mumunyaka wamakkumi musanu akkumi alimwi muchiindi kaali wazyalwa Kkirisitu. Mulembi uliyubununa kali mutumwa Pawulu (BaEfeso 1:1). Basikufunkununa bayingi bazuminana kuti Pawulu ngwakalemba lugwalo lwa <char style="bk">BaEfeso</char> nikuba kuti talukwe kujuzya kwakwe mwini mbuli lwaBaKkolose. Nkaambo kacheechi ngalulaba kuti lwakaleleede kuti lukakuyeenzegwe kumbungano zisiyenesiyene zilimuchilikiti. Pawulu alubo ulaamba kuti wakali muntolongo naakali kulemba lugwalo oolu (BaEfeso 3:1, 4:1, alimwi BaEfeso 6:20). Pawulu wakalayizya Tayikkikkasi lugwalo lwakalikuya mumbungano yakuEfeso kulweendo lwakwe kukuswaya mbungano yaBaEfeso (BaEfeso 6:21-22).</para>
  <para style="ipi">Efeso chakali chisi chipati alimwi kalili dolopo lwachilikiti chaBaRoma kuchisi chaAnatoriya. <char style="bk">Efeso </char>yakali ampuwo yaŋanda yaleza yaayo yakapedekezededwe kuchileza chanakazi chabaGirikki chitegwa Atemisi (Inchito 19:23-31) Imbungano yaku <char style="bk">Efeso</char> yakatalika anguzu pesi kumamanino yakazoowola (Chiyubunuzyo 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulu ulapanduulula muchipanzi chitaanzi chalugwalo lwakwe inzila Leza mbaakasala bantu bakwe akubafutula kuzwa kuzibi zyabo mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu. Ukozyanisya mbungano mbuli mubili aKkirisitu kali mutwe alubo mbuli bulambo Kkirisitu kali musemo waŋanda. Kuchipanzi chabili chalugwalo oolu Pawulu upa malayilile munaKkirisitu mbweelede kupona.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pawulu ulalilugununa akujuzya BaEfeso (BaEfeso 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mpawo ulapandulula bulyidilani bwambungano aKkirisitu (BaEfeso 1:3—3:21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo Pawulu ulemba atala anzila banaKkirisitu mbubeelede kupona aayo (BaEfeso 4:1—6:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kumamanino Pawulu upa majwi akweelelezya (BaEfeso 6:21-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Kujuzya KwaPawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Ime Pawulu, mutumwa waKkirisitu Jesu aluyando lwaLeza,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Kubasalali aabo bali kuEfeso, alimwi basyomekede<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aamwi malembe takwe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bali kuEfeso.</char></note> muli Kkirisitu Jesu:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Luzyalo kulindinywe aluumuno luzwa kuliLeza Taata wesu aMwami Jesu Kkirisitu.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zilongezyo ZyamuMuuya muli Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 1:3">2 Kkor 1:3</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alumbwe Leza aWisi waMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, ooyo wakatulongezya muli Kkirisitu azilongezyo zyoonse zyamuuya mumyeenya yakujulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Nikuba mbuli mbwakatusala mulinguwe kuzwa nyika kiitana kulengwa pe, kuti tube basalali alimwi katutakwe kampenda kunembo lyakwe. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Wakatubamba kale muluyando<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">muluyando </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kunembo lyakwe muluyando, kalibambide kale</char></note> kuti tube bana bakwe mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu, aboobo mukwiinda mumakanze akuyanda kwakwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:13">Kkol 1:13</ref>.</char></note> mukulumbayizya bulemu bwaluzyalo lwakwe oolo ndwakatupa kakutakwe muulo kwiinda muli ooyo Mwana mulombe uyandwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kkol 1:14</ref>.</char></note>Muli Kkirisitu mutwakajana kunununwa mukwiinda mubulowa bwakwe, mukulekelelwa kwazibi zyesu, mukwiinda mubuvubi bwaluzyalo lwakwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />oolo ndwakatupa kapati chabuuya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Abusongo boonse akumvwisisisya <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />wakachita kuti tuzibe, insiiswa yakuyanda kwakwe mbuli nzyakabona kazimukondya mumabambe aakwe muli Kkirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:4">Gal 4:4</ref>.</char></note>Mbuli mabambe akuzulila kwachiindi, kuti Kkirisitu aswaanizye aamwi zyoonse zintu mulinguwe, zintu zilikujulu azintu zili anyika.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Mulinguwe, mukwiinda mukuyanda kwakwe umaninizya zintu zyoonse mukwiinda mbuli mumabambe akuyanda kwakwe kale, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />iswe nitwakaba bataanzi kubulangilizi bwamuli Kkirisitu twakabambilwa kale akusalwa kuti tupone mukutembawula bulemu bwakwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Mulinguwe andinywe lubo, inywe nimwakamvwa ijwi lyakasimpe, makani mabotu alufutuko lwanu, mpawo mwakasyoma mulinguwe, mwakasinizigwa achisyomezyo chaMuuya Usalala, <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:22">2 Kkor 1:22</ref>.</char></note>nchiinchicho chisinizyo chalukono lwesu mane tukajane kunununwa kwawo, muntembawuzyo yabulemu bwakwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomba KwaPawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:9">Kkol 1:9</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nkaambo kacheechi, nkaambo ndakamvwa atala alusyomo lwanu muMwami Jesu aluyando lwanu kubasalali boonse, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:3">Kkol 1:3</ref>.</char></note> tandileki pe kumulumbila, kumuyeeya munkombyo zyangu, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />kuti Leza waMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu, Wisi wabulemu, amupe muuya wabusongo alimwi wachiyubunuzyo muluzibo lwakwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:3">Det 33:3</ref>.</char></note> kamuli ameso akumwinikila myoyo yanu, kuti mukazibe eecho kuti mbuubuli bulangilizi mbwakamwiita aabo, akuti mbuvubiinzi bwalukono bwabulemu mubasalali, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />alimwi kuti niinzi chitakonzyi kweelwa kapati munguzu zyakwe zili mulindiswe nitusyoma, mukwiinda mukubeleka kwanguzu zyakwe mpati <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Int 110:1</ref>.</char></note>eezyo nzyaakamanina muli Kkirisitu aawo naakamubusya kuzwa kubafu mpawo wakamukkazika kuluboko lwakwe lwakululyo mumasena akujulu, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />kwiinda atala abweendelezi boonse abeendelezi anguzu akweendelezya, alimwi atala azina lyoonse liwunikidwe, kutali kwachiindi eechino pesi alubo akuli cheecho chiyobuza; <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Int 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:18">Kkol 1:18</ref>.</char></note> alimwi Leza wakabikka zintu zyoonse aansi andyaato zyaJesu mpawo wakamuchita kuti abe mutwe atala azintu zyoonse nkaambo kambungano, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Rom 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:17">Kkol 2:17</ref>.</char></note> nguunguwo mubili wakwe, mukuzulila kwakwe uzuzya zyoonse koonse.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuzwa Kulufu Kuya Kubuumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Alimwi mwakalifwide mukwiinda mukuleya amuzibi. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:13">Kkol 1:13</ref>.</char></note> Oomo mumwakali kuponena, kamulokutobela misalo yanyika eeyi, kamulokutobela beendelezi banguzu yamumulengalenga, muuya lino ulikubeleka mubana bataswiilili. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Akati kazeezi toonse twakalikupona muzisusi zyamubili wesu, mukutobelezya ziyandisyo zyamubili amuzeezo, alimwi mbuboobo mubili twakali bana babukali, mbuli muntu woonse. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Pesi Leza, ooyo ujisi buvubi muluse, kuzwa kuluyando lwakwe lupati oolo nduwakatuyanda aalo, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />nikuba kuti twakalifwide muzibi zyesu, wakatubusya aamwi aKkirisitu, aluzyalo lwaLeza mwakafutulwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Alimwi Leza wakatubusya aamwi anguwe, mpawo wakatuchita kuti tukakkale anguwe mumasena akujulu muli Kkirisitu Jesu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />kuti muzyiindi ziza azokonzye kutondeezya buvubi bugambya bwaluzyalo lwakwe mubuuya kulindiswe muliKkirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo aluzyalo mwakafutulwa mukwiinda mulusyomo; alimwi eechi tachizwi kulindinywe pe, pesi eechi nchipo chizwa kuli Leza, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />peepe nkaambo kamilimu, kuchitila kuti kutabi muntu ulikankayizya. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Nkaambo tuli mulimu wamaanza aakwe, twakalengwa muli Kkirisitu Jesu kuti tuchite milimu mibotu, eeyo Leza njakabaamba kale, kuti twiichite.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuba Bamwi Muli Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Nkikaako amuyeeye kuti muli chimwi chiindi chakayinda inywe mwakatali baJuda akuzyala, bayiitwa kuti batapalulwidwe abaabo baambwa kuti chilipalwidwe, eecho chichitwa mumubili amaboko, <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Ay 57:19</ref>.</char></note> amuyeeye kuti muchiindi eecho mwakalaanzene kuzwa kuli Kkirisitu, kamuli bazwakule kuchisi chaIzirayeli, alimwi kamuli beenzu kuzizuminano zyachisyomezyo, kamutakwe bulangilizi, alimwi kamutakwe Leza munyika. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Pesi lino muli Kkirisitu Jesu inywe nimwakali kule mwakeetwa afwiifwi abulowa bwaKkirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Nkaambo nguunguwe luumuno lwesu, ooyo wakatuchita aaba babili kuba uumwi, alimwi wakamweya bulambo bwakatupambukeniye bwakusulana, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />akunyonyoona mumubili wakwe mulawu amalayilile aziyaanza, kuti akonzye kuchita mulinguwe muntu uumwi mupya abusena bwababili, kuti kube luumuno, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />alimwi kuti ababweedezye aaba babili kuliLeza mumubili uumwi mukwiinda muchiingano, anchicho akweeta kumana kwansulano. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Ay 57:19</ref>.</char></note> Mpawo wakaza alimwi wakambawuka luumuno kulibaabo bakali kule alumuuno kulibaabo bakali afwiifwi; <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />nkaambo kwiinda mulinguwe iswe babili twaba achelelo muMuuya uumwi kuli Taata.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Eelyo aboobo tamuchili beenzu pe abazwakule, pesi muli bamukowa uumwi abasalali alimwi zizo zyaŋanda yaLeza, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />bayakidwe atala antalisyo yabatumwa abasinsimi, Kkirisitu Jesu mwini kali musemo waŋanda, <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />mulinguwe ŋanda yoonse mwiiswenene aamwi mpawo ilaba mpati mane ibe ŋanda yaLeza isalala muMwami; <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />oomo andinywe mumuyakidwe mube busena Leza mbwakkala muMuuya.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mulimu WaPawulu Kuli Batazi Leza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Nkaambo kacheechi ime, Pawulu, ndimwaange waKkirisitu Jesu muchiimo chanu batazi Leza pe, <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:25">Kkol 1:25</ref>.</char></note> kandiyeeya kuti mwakamvwa atala abubanzi bwaluzyalo lwaLeza oobo bwakapegwa kulindime nkaambo kanu, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />amunzila insiiswa mbuyazibikana kulindime achiyubunuzyo, mbuli mbundakalemba mubufwiifwi. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Nimuyoobala eechi muyoomvwisisisya maanu aangu ali munsiswa yaKkirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />eeyo yakatazibikana kubana babantu kuli aamwi mazyalani mbuli mbuyakayubununwa lino kubatumwa bakwe basalali abasinsimi mukwiinda aMuuya; <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:27">Kkol 1:27</ref>.</char></note> mbumbuboobo, batamuzi Leza mbubakaba basilukono, zizo zyamubili uumwi, alimwi basibulidilani bwachisyomezyo chamuli Kkirisitu Jesu mukwiinda mumakani mabotu. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ayaaya makani mabotu ndakachiitwa kuba mulanda kwiinda muchipo chaluzyalo lwaLeza eecho nchindakapegwa mukubeleka kwanguzu zyakwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Kulindime, nikuba kuti ndimuchalizi kapati kuli boonse basalali, oolu luzyalo lwakapegwa kulindime, kukukambawuka kuli batamuzi pe Leza buvubi butamvwisisyiki bwaKkirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26">Kkol 1:26</ref>.</char></note> alimwi kuti ndichite bantu boonse babone kuti makanze ansiiswa isitikide kuzwa kale muli Leza ooyo wakalenga zintu zyoonse; <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />kuti mukwiinda mumbungano kuyubununwe busongo busiyenesiyene bwaLeza kuti bukonzye lino kuzibikana kubweendelezi amunguzu zyamasena alikujulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Eechi chakali mumabambe atamani aayo ngakazuzikizya muli Kkirisitu Jesu Mwami wesu, <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />muli ooyo ngutujisi busichaamba akutayoowa amweenya mukwiinda mulusyomo lwesu mulinguwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Aboobo ndamukumbila kuti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kuti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuchitila kuti ndita</char></note> mutalengwani atala azeezi nzindili kumufwabila, mbuumbubo bulemu bwanu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyando LwaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Nkaambo kacheechi ndilafugama amazwi angu kunembo lyaTaata, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />kuzwa kuli ooyo impuli yoonse kujulu amunyika mpuzyuunikidwe, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />kuti mukwiinda mubuvubi bwabulemu bwakwe kuti akamusimye changuzu mukwiinda muMuuya wakwe mumuntu wamukati, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />alimwi kuti Kkirisitu akkale mumyoyo yanu mukwiinda mulusyomo; kuti inywe, nimuzyatide animunikide muluyando, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />kuti mukabe anguzu kumvwisisisya aboonse basalali mukukwazama abulamfu alimwi bwimvwi amukunika, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />alimwi kuti muzibe luyando lwaKkirisitu oolo lwiinda luzibo, kuti mukazuzigwe abuna Leza buzwide.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Lino kulinguwe ooyo alanguzu zibeleka mulindiswe ukonzya kuchita zyindilide mubwiingi kwiinda zyoonse nzitukumbila nikuba nzituyeeya, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />kulinguwe kube bulemu mumbungano amuli Kkirisitu Jesu kumazyalani woonse, kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kukamantana Kwamubili WaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Nkikaako ime, ndimwaange nkaambo kakukutawukila Mwami, ndamukumbila kuti mupone buumi bweelela lwiito oolo ndumwakayitwa aalo, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kkol 3:12-13</ref>.</char></note>akulifwiinsya koonse amoyo mubombe, amoyo mulamfu, mukunyampuzyaniya mukuli umwi awumwi muluyando, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />mukuyanda kubamba bukamantani bwaMuuya mubukamantani bwaluumuno. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kuli mubili uumwi aMuuya uumwi, mbuli mbumwakayitwa kubulangilizi bumwi oobo bwakulwiito lwanu, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Mwami uumwi, lusyomo lumwi, lubbapatizyo lumwi, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Leza uumwi aTaata wesu toonse, uuli atala azyoonse alimwi mukwiinda kuli zyoonse amuli zyoonse.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Pesi luzyalo lwakapegwa kuli uumwi awuumwi wesu mukwiinda mumweelo wachipo chaKkirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Int 68:18</ref>.</char></note> Nkikaako nchikwaambwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Naakatanta kuya kujulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">wakazulwida baange weenda aabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">mpawo wakapa zipo kubantu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Mukwaamba, “Wakatanta kujulu,” chaambaanzi eechi pesi kuti alimwi wakaseluka mumasena alaansi amunyika? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ooyo wakaseluka nguunguwe alimwi wakatanta kwiinda majulu woonse, kuti akonzye kuzuzya zintu zyoonse. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Alimwi zipo zyakwe zyakali zyakuti bamwi babe batumwa, bamwi babe basinsimi, bamwi babe bakambawusi alimwi bamwi babe beembeli<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bafundisi</char></note> abayiisi, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />kuti mubambile basalali kumulimu yabukambawusi, mukuyaka mubili waKkirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />mane toonse tukasike kulukamantano lwalusyomo akuluzibo lwaMwana waLeza, mukuzulila kwabuntu, mukweleela chiimo chizwide chaKkirisitu; <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />kuchitila kuti tutabi limbi mbuli bana, bawungwa kufumbwa alimwi kabatolwa kufumbwa iguwo lyanjiisyo isowa, amizeezo yabantu yeneena, abusintaze nibakayeneena mukuyubilila. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kkol 1:18</ref>.</char></note> Nikuboobo, kwaambuula kasimpe muluyando, kuti tweleede kukomene muzyiimo zyoonse mulinguwe ooyo uli mutwe, ooyo ulinguwe Kkirisitu, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kkol 2:19</ref>.</char></note> kuzwa kuli ooyo mubili woonse, muukamantene akusumwa aamwi azipanzi zyoonse zipedwe, kuti chizo chimwi achimwi kachibeleka oobotu, chipa kuti mubili ukomene alimwi ulaliyaka kwiinda muluyando.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buumi Bupya Muli Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Lino ndamwaambila eechi akupa bukamboni muMwami, kuti mutaponi mbuli bamwi batamwizi Leza mbubapona, mukunyonyooka kwamizeezo yabo; <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />bakasizigwa mukumvwisisya kwabo, bakasosolosegwa kukuzwa mubuumi bwaLeza nkaambo kakubula luzibo luli muli mbaabo, nkaambo kabuyumu bwamoyo wabo; <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />bakaba bantu batachikwe bweeme pe alimwi bakalipeda kuzisusi zibi zyamubili, mubusindya bwakupona mubusofwazi bwazibi boonse.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Tee mwakamwiiya pe Kkirisitu munzila eeyo! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Kandiyeeya kuti mwakamvwa atala anguwe alimwi mwakayiisigwa mulinguwe, mbuli kasimpe kali muli Jesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Amuleke chiimo chanu chikulukulu eecho chizwa kubuumi bukulukulu alimwi bukompeme mukwiinda munjalalando ziyunga, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />mpawo muchitululwe mumuuya yamumizeezo yanu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />alimwi akusama chiimo chipya, eecho chilengedwe muchiimo chaLeza mukasimpe kabusalali abululami.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nkikaako, amuleke bubeji, muntu woonse aambuule kasimpe angwaayakilene aawe, nkaambo iswe tulizizo zyamubili uumwi. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Amunyeme pesi mutabisyi; mutabbizyi zuba kamunyemede, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />alimwi utamupi mweenya Sikuchenga. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Ooyo mubbi atachinoobbi limbi pe, pesi abeleke, kachita milimu isyomekede amaboko aakwe, kuchitila kuti akonzye kupa aabo babula. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Kutazwi twaambo tubi mumilomo yanu, pesi buyo aayo mabotu kukuyaka, mbuli mbukweelede aawo, kuti zikape luzyalo kulibaabo bamvwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Alimwi mutanyemyi Muuya Usalala waLeza, mulinguwe mwakasinizigwa nkaambo kabuzuba bwakunununwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Amuleke mfwindiilili zyoonse abukali akunyema akukalala amatusi azizwe akati kanu, amajwi ataluleme woonse, <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />amube abuuya kuli wumwi awumwi, mube amoyo mutete, mulekelelane, mbuli Leza kwiinda muliKkirisitu mbwakamulekelela.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kupona Mumumuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Nkikaako amwiiye kuli Leza, mbuli bana bayandwa, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kul 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:41">Ezekk 20:41</ref>.</char></note> alimwi mweende muluyando, mbuli Kkirisitu mbwakatuyanda mpawo wakalipeda nkaambo kesu, wakaba chipo chinunkilila achipayizyo kuli Leza.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Pesi bumambi abusofwazi boonse nikuba bwanka, tazyeelede pe nikuba kwaambwa akati kanu, tazyeelede pe ziliboobu akati kabasalali. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kutabi buubi, nikuba masampu, nikuba kuchengana, ziteelede; nikuba boobo ngakube kupa kulumba. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ngamube akasimpe acheechi, kuti takwe simamambi nikuba busofwazi, nikuba bwanka (chaamba, bapiila mizimu) ulaalukono mubwami bwaKkirisitu abwaLeza.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Kutabi uumwi umuyuunga amajwi abuyo, nkaambo kazeezi zintu kuti bukali bwaLeza bulaza kubantu bataswiilili. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nkikaako mutabi abulyidilani ambabo, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />nkaambo kale mwakali mudima, pesi lino muli mumuni muMwami; amweende mbuli bana bamumuni, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />nkaambo muchelo wamumuni ujanwa muli zyoonse zibotu aziluleme abwiini. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Amweezye kwiiya eezyo zikondelezya kuMwami. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mutabi achakuchita mumilimu itakwe muchelo yamumudima, pesi nikubaboobo muyiiyubunune. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Nkaambo zipa bweeme nikuba kwaambuula atala azintu eezyo nzibachita munsite; <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />pesi kuti kufumbwa chintu chayubununwa amumuni inga chaliboniya, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />nkaambo kufumbwa chintu eecho chaliboniya mumuni. Nkikaako nchikwaambwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Asinsimuka, iwe nuleede, alimwi buka kuzwa kubafu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">mpawo Kkirisitu uyoomumwinikila.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Eelyo amulange kabotu mbumupona, peepe mbuli bantu batali basongo, pesi mbuli basongo, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kkol 4:5</ref>.</char></note> amubelesye kabotu chiindi chiingi, nkaambo mazuba aaya mabi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Nkikaako mutabi bafubafuba, pesi amumvwisisisye kuti kuyanda kwaMwami nkuuli.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Alimwi mutakolwi awayini, nkaambo eecho chitoola kukutalizyotolola; pesi amuzuzigwe aMuuya, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Kkol 3:16-17</ref>.</char></note> amwaambuzyaniye umwi awumwi antembawuzyo amalelebu anyiimbo zyamuuya, kamwiimba akulumbayizya kuMwami mumoyo wanu woonse, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />lyoonse alimwi kuzintu zyoonse kamupa kulumba muzina lyaMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu kuli Leza Taata.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banakazi aBalumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kamulibombya kuli uumwi awumwi muchite oobo mulemeka Kkirisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22—6:9. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:18-4:1">Kkol 3:18—4:1</ref>.</char>
    </note> Nibanakazi, amulibombye kubalumi banu, mbuli kuMwami. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Nkaambo mwaalumi ngumutwe wamwanakazi mbuli Kkirisitu mbali mutwe wambungano, mubili wakwe, alimwi nguMufutuli wayo lwakwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Mbuli mbungano mbuyiili libombya kuli Kkirisitu, mbumbubo alubo banakazi ngabalibombye mulizyoonse kubalumi babo.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Nibalumi, amubayande banakazi banu, mbuli Kkirisitu mbwakiiyanda mbungano mpawo wakalipeda nkaambo kayo, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />kuti akamusazye, kali kumusalazya akumusanzya ameenda ajwi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />kuti akayitondeezye imbungano kulinguwe nkilabulemu, kiitakwe kabata nikuba kiitafwiinyene nikuba chintu kufumbwa chiloobo, kuti isalale alimwi katakwe kampenda. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Nikuba boobo balumi beleede bayande banakazi babo mbuli mibili yabo. Kufumbwa uyanda mwanakazi wakwe ulaliyanda mwini. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />(Nkaambo takukwe muntu usula mubili wakwe pe, pesi ulusanina akuyibamba, mbuli Kkirisitu mbwachita kumbungano, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />nkaambo iswe tulizizo zyamubili wakwe.) <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Matl 2:24</ref>.</char></note> “Nkaambo kazeezi mwaalumi uyoosiya wisi abanyina alimwi akakamantane kumwanakazi wakwe, alimwi aaba babili bayooba mubili uumwi.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Eeyi ninsiswa mpati, alimwi ndilokwaamba kuti eechi mukozyano waamba atala aKkirisitu ambungano. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nikubaboobo, umwi awumwi ayande mwanakazi wakwe mbuli mbaliyanda alakwe, alimwi mwanakazi ngalange kuti alemeke mulumi wakwe.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Bana aBazyali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Nubana, amuswilile bazyali banu muMwami, nkaambo eechi chililuleme. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kul 20:12</ref>.</char></note> “Lemeka wuso abanyoko” nkaambo ooyu ngumulawu mutaanzi ula chisyomezyo: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:16">Det 5:16</ref>.</char></note> “kuti zikweendele obotu, alimwi kuti upone chiindi chilamfu anyika.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Nimataata, mutababilizyi bana banu, pesi amubakomezye mukululamika amululayo lwaMwami.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bazike aBasimalelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Nibazike, amubaswilile basimalelo banu baansi, akulibombya akuyoowa, mumoyo uumwi, mumizeezo mibotu kazizwa mumyoyo wanu ululeme mbuli kuli Kkirisitu; <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />kutabi kwakuupawupa kumeso pe, mbuli sikubotezya bantu, pesi mbuli bazike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naakuti </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bazike </char></note> baKkirisitu, mukuchita luyando lwaLeza kuzwa mumoyo, <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />mukuchita mulimu akuyanda kubotu mbuli kuMwami akutali kubantu pe, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />kamuzi kuti kufumbwa chibotu muntu nchachita, uyootambula nchicho lubo kuzwa kuMwami, nikuba kuti muzike nikuba waangunikide.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Nibasimalelo, amuchite oobo kulimbabo, muleke kubaluvukila, kamuzi kuti ooyo ulinguwe Simalelo wabo antoomwe andinywe ulikujulu, alimwi kuti kulinguwe takukwe kusalulwa pe.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zilwanisyo Zyoonse ZyaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Kumeelelezyo, amube bakozu muMwami amunguzu zyakwe mpati. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Amusame zilwanisyo zyoonse zyaLeza, kuchitila kuti mukakonzye kwimikila mumeeneno aSikuchenga. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Nkaambo tatulwani abulowa amubili pe, pesi tulwana abeendelezi abweendelezi anguzu amubwendeelezi bwamudima bwanyika eyino amuuya isofweede mumasena alikujulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nkikaako amusame zilwanisyo zyoonse zyaLeza, kuchitila kuti mukakonzye kwiimikila mubuzuba bwabubi, nimwachita zyoonse, mulayimikila nji.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:5">Ay 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59:17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Tes 5:8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nkikaako amuyimikile, kazizwide zikungu zyanu alukumba lwakasimpe, alimwi musame intobo yabululami, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Ay 52:7</ref>.</char></note> alimwi kamusamide insangu kumawulu aanu kukubambila makani mabotu aluumuno; <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />kunze azyoonse eezi, amubweeze intobo yalusyomo, anjiyo muyokonzya kuzima mivwi yoonse iyaka yamubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Mpawo amusame nguwani yalubulo <note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ingwani yankondo</char></note> yalufutuko, apanga lyaMuuya, chaamba ijwi lyaLeza. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Amukombe zyiindi zyoonse muMuuya, ankombyo zyoonse amukukumbila. Kulizeezi kamuchenjede akukakatila koonse, akukumbilila basalali boonse, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />alimwi andime lubo, kuti kwaambuula kupegwe kulindime mukubbanuna mulomo wangu abusichamba mukukambawuka insiiswa yamakani mabotu, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />nkaambo kakuti ime ndilimwiiminini mubwaange. Amukombe kuti ndikaambe abusichaamba, mbuli mbundeelede kwaambuula.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuzya Kwakumamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:21. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Inch 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tim 4:12</ref>.</char>
    </note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7">Kkol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref>.</char></note> Lino kuti andinywe mukonzye kuziba lubo mbundibede anzindiliikuchita, Tayikkikkasi mukwesu ngundiyandisya alimwi mukambawusi usyomekede muMwami uyomwaambila zyoonse. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ndamutuma kulindinywe nkaambo kamabambe aaya, kuti mukonzye kuziba kuti tuli biyeni, akuti azosungwazye myoyo yanu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Bakwesu luumuno lube kulindinywe aluyando alusyomo luzwa kuli Leza Taata aMwami Jesu Kkirisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Luzyalo lube andinywe moonse nimuyanda Mwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu aluyando luteeli.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>